      "text": "Whether you are stuck at home or managing a fleet on the move, **Pete’s Mobile Mechanical Services** brings the garage directly to your doorstep. With over **30 years of industry experience**, I provide expert care for everything from motorbikes and cars to motorhomes and heavy-duty wagons. Why deal with the hassle of a workshop when a seasoned professional can handle it on-site?\n### **Comprehensive On-Site Repairs**\nI offer a wide range of mobile services designed to keep your vehicle safe and reliable:\n* **Engine Servicing & Diagnostics:** Precision tuning and fault finding.\n* **Safety Criticals:** Expert repairs for brakes, steering, and suspension.\n* **Drivetrain & Exhaust:** Professional transmission and exhaust system maintenance.\n* **Specialized Care:** Tailored services for vans, buses, coaches, and \"just about anything on wheels.\"\n### **Pricing & Estimates**\nI pride myself on transparency and convenience. All major services start from **£200 plus parts**, and I am happy to provide a **free, no-obligation estimate** before any work begins.\n### **Get in Touch**\nSave time and skip the waiting room. Contact me today to get back on the road:\n* **Phone:** 07781 122440\n*(If I’m under a bonnet and can’t answer, please leave a voicemail or text and I’ll get back to you ASAP!)*\n* **Email:** petesmobilemechanicalservices@gmail.com\n**Professional service, delivered to your door.**\n\nHi all.\nJust to let everyone know that I'm off Island at the moment and I will be back to normal on Monday.\nIn the meantime please leave a short voice message or send me a text or WhatsApp and I’ll answer as soon as possible.\nThanks.\nPete\n See less",
